<div class="footnote"><p>
<a id="Footnote_5_13" href="#FNanchor_5_13" class="label">[13]</a>
Bossuet, <cite>Works</cite>, <abbr title="volume 21, page 53">t. xxi. p. 53.</abbr>
</p></div>

<div class="footnote"><p>
<a id="Footnote_5_14" href="#FNanchor_5_14" class="label">[14]</a>
